    "description": "Pedal Commander is a throttle response controller that removes response delays on your electronic accelerator pedal. Effectively, it allows your engine to respond faster so your car can accelerate faster! You paid lots of money for a serious vehicle; when you press your gas pedal, it shouldn\u2019t feel like you are pressing a sponge. Haven\u2019t you ever noticed that older cars tend to be more responsive, before digital pedals? We\u2019re giving you that response back!\r\n\r\nPedal Commander has 4 different control modes: Eco, City, Sport, and Sport+ . Each control mode has 8 adjustable levels to work with. These different settings are what provide drivers with unique acceleration control in their vehicles.\r\n\r\nThe Bluetooth integration of Pedal Commander unit helps you to drive your vehicle freely by removing the dependency of hand controller unit and improves your drive efficiency for the best!\r\n\r\nThe application is also easy to install and use. Just download from Google PlayStore, open the application and enter your Pedal Commander's unique Serial Number.\r\n\r\nPlease do not hesitate to contact us for any bug reports and decisions!\r\nReady to drive!",
